CheckInEgateConsoleLog_TC_B_10
    [Documentation]    Check on Egate_console.log following messages are present and set with the same value
    ...                     (eg here 7 but the value can be another one) :
	...                     drx-LongCycleStartOffset ms160 : 7,
	...                     periodicityAndOffset sl80 : 7,
    ...                     reportSlotConfig slots40 : 7,
    sleep   60
    ${drxLongCycleStartOffset}     Set Variable        'drx-LongCycleStartOffset ms160'
    ${periodicityAndOffset}      Set Variable        "periodicityAndOffset sl80"
    ${reportSlotConfig}          Set Variable        "reportSlotConfig slots160"

    ${msg}    Catenate    Check in egate_console.log:  ${drxLongCycleStartOffset}
    ...                   ${periodicityAndOffset}  and  ${reportSlotConfig}
    Dated Log New Line      ${msg}
    ${alias}       SSH Connect          ${HOST_EPCSIM}
    ${value_periodicityAndOffset}     CheckInEgateConsoleLog     searchKeyword=${periodicityAndOffset}     alias=${alias}
    ${value_reportSlotConfig}     CheckInEgateConsoleLog     searchKeyword=${reportSlotConfig}     alias=${alias}
    sleep   60
    ${value_drxLongCycleStartOffset}     CheckInEgateConsoleLog     searchKeyword=${drxLongCycleStartOffset}    alias=${alias}
    Check Parameters Values TC_10    ${value_periodicityAndOffset}
    ...    ${value_reportSlotConfig}
    ...    ${value_drxLongCycleStartOffset}

Check Parameters Values TC_10
    [Arguments]    ${value_periodicityAndOffset}
    ...            ${value_reportSlotConfig}
    ...            ${value_drxLongCycleStartOffset}
    Should Be Equal    ${value_periodicityAndOffset}    ${value_reportSlotConfig}
    Should Be Equal    ${value_periodicityAndOffset}    ${value_drxLongCycleStartOffset}

CheckInEgateConsoleLog
    [Arguments]    ${searchKeyword}
    ...            ${alias}
    ${cmd}=        Catenate    grep -m1 ${searchKeyword} ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log
    ...            | cut -d ":" -f2 | sed 's/,.*//'
    ${output}=     SSH Exec
    ...            command=${cmd}
    ...            alias=${alias}
    ...            debug=${True}
    Dated Log  ${output}
    [Return]       ${output}

Teardown 7738-B
    [Arguments]                 ${alias}=${HOST_EPCSIM.alias}
    BuiltIn.log      alias is ${alias}
    BuiltIn.Log      \nTest ${TEST_NAME} 7738 ending   console=yes
    Retrieve Logs

Retrieve Logs
    [Tags]                          Retrieve Logs
    [Timeout]                       20 minute
    OAM Get Active Alarms
    Setup.Get Sos Report
    Set Suite Variable    ${testCaseDir}    None

Setup Test Case 7738-B
    Run Keywords    Set Suite Variable    ${testCaseDir}                  None    AND
    ...       Set Suite Variable          ${dl_expect_tput_value}         90      AND
    ...       Set Suite Variable          ${ul_expect_tput_value}         30      AND
    #         deviation need to take into account crm ul settings
    ...       Set Suite Variable          ${deviation}                    5       AND
    ...       common_Dss_Keywords.Get testcase log directory                      AND
    ...       Set Global Variable         ${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}    0       AND
    ...       depends   TestLine_7738_Test_setup
